#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1073 expect=skipped domain=CM
#note "FRESH: dataset CM carrying CMOCCUR (a perfectly legal CM variable). Scope.Domains.Include is [AE], so the domain axis rejects -> auditable skip. Evidence fixture for finding SD1073-F1: the sheet row's DOMAINS cell says ALL, so this pins that the corpus realises the generic row as one AE-specific check rather than a corpus-wide prohibition sweep."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset CM class=INTERVENTIONS
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN  type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col CMSEQ   type=Num
col CMTRT   type=Char
col CMOCCUR type=Char
---
S1 | CM | 001 | 1 | ASPIRIN | Y
